  "content": "\n\n<p><del><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組將&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Roadhog360/Et-Futurum-Requiem/pull/158\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併至</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/et-futurum-requiem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Et Futurum Requiem</a>，若您需要的未來內容超過鍛造台，請使用 EFR！（在最新版本中，相關代碼似乎已被註解。待功能重新加入後，刪除線將會移除）</span></del></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組將&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>下界合金</strong></span>相關物品與鍛造台帶回舊版 Minecraft。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">實作清單：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">遠古殘骸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">下界合金碎片、錠與塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">下界合金劍；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">下界合金工具；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">下界合金盔甲；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">鍛造台；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">相關成就；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">......</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入您的模組包中。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
